{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1540768-geists-and-rank","id":1540768,"title":"Geists and Rank","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-20T07:45:06-07:00","id":1540768,"title":"Geists and Rank","content":"I think I am missing something, when a Geist goes up rank, does it gain new attributes in line with the new rank? If not, how does a Geist increase it's attributes? If not, then isn't a Rank 4 Geist the weakest version of a Rank 4 being, since they only get 12 points for Attributes, which is inline with a Rank 2 Spirit. It seems quite off that this &quot;little death god&quot; has a general lower Power, Finesse, and Resistance trait lower than any other Rank 3 being, much less a Rank 4.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25650-jacook03","name":"Jacook03","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25650_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-20T08:51:30-07:00","id":1540773,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jacook03</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1540768-geists-and-rank#post1540768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I am missing something, when a Geist goes up rank, does it gain new attributes in line with the new rank?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not a Bound one, no. A Sin-Eater can't gain eleven dots of Attributes on their fallback option for the price of a three-dot Merit.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If not, how does a Geist increase it's attributes? </div> </div> </div>As a part of a player character, it doesn't, unless you're extending the mechanics for the Absent, in which case you spend Experiences for the ghost that you're playing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If not, then isn't a Rank 4 Geist the weakest version of a Rank 4 being, since they only get 12 points for Attributes, which is inline with a Rank 2 Spirit.It seems quite off that this &quot;little death god&quot; has a general lower Power, Finesse, and Resistance trait lower than any other Rank 3 being, much less a Rank 4. </div> </div> </div>The geist of a player character gets 12 dots to distribute between their Attributes in addition to the one dot in each that they get for free, for a total of 15, the standard minimum for a Rank 3 ghost.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":